{
  "title": "Swing\u2013stance rank coupling does not establish superior cross-collection Parkinson gait prediction",
  "abstract": "Within-stride swing/stance rank correlation yielded a small exploratory cross-collection logloss change of -0.007416 (joint-bootstrap95% interval [-0.06336541334756039, 0.031060293543247516]), not reliable superiority. A simpler conventional model outperformed the augmented primary model on logloss.",
